  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Aktiviteten saknar beskrivning. Kontakta Sida f&#xf6;r mer information. Ring +46 8 698 50 00 eller skicka e-post till sida@sida.se.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The development objective is to support the reform of the Georgian health care system.The project period is April 2003 - December 2005 and the project consits of three sectors i e hospital management, management and maintenance of services of hospital equipment, and hospital infection control. The project partners are the Georgian Ministry of Labour, Health and Social Affairs and Swedish Health Care</narrative>
